{"itemId":"dg-summa","armId":"DG-SUMMA","batchId":"decider-grok-v1","frameId":"blank-supply-v2-120","contentHash":"93e5d2aa6392b1dcbf41f398c33fa42cffbcc990a835a5a55536752218640be7","split":"confirmatory","subType":"SUMMARY_COMPLETE","difficulty":"INTERMEDIATE","plan":"STANDARD","profile":null,"outcome":"accepted","fatalError":null,"ms":95759,"slots":2,"calls":[{"stageKey":"question.structured","purpose":"candidate","slotConsumed":true,"ok":false,"ms":60014,"error":"Invalid JSON response"},{"stageKey":"question.structured","purpose":"candidate","slotConsumed":true,"ok":true,"ms":35741,"usage":{"inputTokens":8555,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":8427,"cacheReadTokens":128},"outputTokens":2523,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":599,"reasoningTokens":1924},"totalTokens":11078,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":8555,"completion_tokens":2523,"total_tokens":11078,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":128},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1924},"cost":0.032056,"is_byok":false,"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.032056,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.016918,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.015138}},"reasoningTokens":1924,"cachedInputTokens":128,"costUsd":0.032056,"generationId":"gen-1784312713-bftpBHyasLQFftnwHTH2","upstreamProvider":"xAI","servedModel":"x-ai/grok-4.5"}}],"costUsd":0.032056,"accepted":{"direction":"다음 글의 내용을 한 문장으로 요약하고자 한다. 빈칸 (A), (B)에 들어갈 말을 쓰시오.","summaryWithBlanks":"Digital platforms make work less sticky by enabling cloudwork that disconnects service work from particular places, allowing employers to switch freelancers simply by (A) and to leave behind (B) in those places.","blanks":[{"label":"(A)","answer":"sending emails or clicking buttons","acceptedAnswers":["sending emails or clicking buttons","sending some emails or clicking some buttons","sending emails or clicking some buttons","sending some emails or clicking buttons"]},{"label":"(B)","answer":"no material traces","acceptedAnswers":["no material traces","no material traces of employment"]}],"correctAnswer":"(A) sending emails or clicking buttons, (B) no material traces","explanation":"글은 digital platforms와 cloudwork가 노동을 장소에서 분리(less sticky)시킨다고 설명한다. 1990년대 아웃소싱과 달리 이메일 발송이나 디지털 업무 플랫폼 버튼 클릭만으로 뉴욕 소기업도 나이로비·뉴델리 프리랜서를 쉽게 전환해 고용할 수 있다. 이 과정에서 사무실·공장을 세우지 않고 현지 규제·세금 부담도 거의 없으며, 고용주는 고용한 장소에 ‘no material traces’를 남기지 않는다고 결론짓는다. 따라서 요약문의 (A)에는 전환 방식이, (B)에는 그 결과로 남는 흔적의 부재가 들어간다.","keyPoints":["cloudwork는 노동을 모듈화·표준화하여 특정 장소와의 연계를 끊어 less sticky하게 만든다","고용 전환은 이메일 발송이나 플랫폼 버튼 클릭 같은 단순한 디지털 행위로 이루어진다","사무실 건설·현지 규제·세금 부담이 없어 고용주는 장소에 material traces를 남기지 않는다"],"tags":["요약문 완성","서술형","클라우드워크","디지털 플랫폼","지리적 단절","핵심 내용 파악"],"difficulty":"INTERMEDIATE","_typeId":"SUMMARY_COMPLETE","_typeLabel":"요약문 완성","_generationPlan":"STANDARD"},"acceptedGateIssues":[],"rejectedCandidates":[],"rejectionIssues":[],"usageEvents":[{"phase":"question_generation","subType":"SUMMARY_COMPLETE","qualityMode":"strict","difficulty":"INTERMEDIATE","generationPlan":"STANDARD","usage":{"inputTokens":8555,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":8427,"cacheReadTokens":128},"outputTokens":2523,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":599,"reasoningTokens":1924},"totalTokens":11078,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":8555,"completion_tokens":2523,"total_tokens":11078,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":128},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1924},"cost":0.032056,"is_byok":false,"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.032056,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.016918,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.015138}},"reasoningTokens":1924,"cachedInputTokens":128,"costUsd":0.032056,"generationId":"gen-1784312713-bftpBHyasLQFftnwHTH2","upstreamProvider":"xAI","servedModel":"x-ai/grok-4.5"},"provider":"atlascloud","modelId":"x-ai/grok-4.5","attempts":1,"durationMs":35741}],"armTrail":null,"armExtra":{"funnelAttempts":2,"relaxedFallback":false,"rejectionSummary":{"total":1,"phaseCounts":{"model":1,"postprocess":0,"quality":0},"topCodes":[],"lastIssue":{"phase":"model",