{"itemId":"dg-fill_","armId":"DG-FILL_","batchId":"decider-grok-v1","frameId":"grammar-frame-v2-096","contentHash":"8336e5488015b84d532b2e37113bc09c678aad8afa08356e7264ede7dbd8a70d","split":"confirmatory","subType":"FILL_BLANK_KEY","difficulty":"INTERMEDIATE","plan":"STANDARD","profile":null,"outcome":"accepted","fatalError":null,"ms":115411,"slots":2,"calls":[{"stageKey":"question.structured","purpose":"candidate","slotConsumed":true,"ok":false,"ms":60007,"error":"Invalid JSON response"},{"stageKey":"question.structured","purpose":"candidate","slotConsumed":true,"ok":true,"ms":55400,"usage":{"inputTokens":9144,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":8888,"cacheReadTokens":256},"outputTokens":3762,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":374,"reasoningTokens":3388},"totalTokens":12906,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":9144,"completion_tokens":3762,"total_tokens":12906,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":3388},"cost":0.040476,"is_byok":false,"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.040476,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.017904,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.022572}},"reasoningTokens":3388,"cachedInputTokens":256,"costUsd":0.040476,"generationId":"gen-1784312713-6e6l8ips4mWPDCHaAVNZ","upstreamProvider":"xAI","servedModel":"x-ai/grok-4.5"}}],"costUsd":0.040476,"accepted":{"direction":"다음 빈칸에 들어갈 알맞은 말을 본문에서 찾아 쓰시오.","sentenceWithBlank":"Yet, in spite of numerous attempts to develop a more musical music curriculum for the majority of school pupils, the emphasis is still on pupils _____.","answer":"absorbing factual information about music","acceptedAnswers":["absorbing factual information about music"],"correctAnswer":"absorbing factual information about music","explanation":"빈칸 문장은 보다 음악적인 교육과정을 만들려는 노력에도 불구하고 학교 현장의 초점이 여전히 어디에 있는지를 비판적으로 요약한다. 앞에서 음악은 현재의 제시 행위와 분리될 수 없으며, 과거의 사실 지식에 기대는 교육과 잘 맞지 않는다고 했으므로, 여전히 이루어지는 것은 음악에 관한 사실 정보 습득임을 연결해야 한다. 따라서 빈칸에는 ‘absorbing factual information about music’이 온다.","keyPoints":["음악은 과거·미래 없이 ‘지금’에만 존재하며, 그 의미는 제시 행위와 분리될 수 없다.","사실 지식 중심 교육은 음악을 ‘여기 지금’에 존재하게 하는 성격과 잘 맞지 않는다.","음악 교육과정 개혁 시도에도 불구하고 여전히 사실 정보 흡수에 초점이 맞춰져 있다는 것이 글의 비판점이다."],"tags":["핵심 표현","빈칸 서술형","음악 교육","논지 파악"],"difficulty":"INTERMEDIATE","passageWithBlank":"Music has no past; it exists only at the moment when it happens, and no two performances are identical. This is music's greatest asset because it brings out the essential 'now' without implications of a past and a potential future. Thus, Stravinsky pointed out that only through music are we able to 'realize the present.' Musical 'meaning' cannot be separated from the act of presentation. However, the necessity of present-ing music - making it present here and now, without which it will not be music at all - does not sit easily with a concept of education that rests mainly upon received factual knowledge and which, by tradition, uses the past to make sense of the present. If we want music to have a role in general education, it would seem logical to acknowledge this difference and give prominence to activities that will involve all pupils working directly with music. Yet, in spite of numerous attempts to develop a more musical music curriculum for the majority of school pupils, the emphasis is still on pupils _____.","_typeId":"FILL_BLANK_KEY","_typeLabel":"핵심 표현 빈칸","_generationPlan":"STANDARD"},"acceptedGateIssues":[],"rejectedCandidates":[],"rejectionIssues":[],"usageEvents":[{"phase":"question_generation","subType":"FILL_BLANK_KEY","qualityMode":"strict","difficulty":"INTERMEDIATE","generationPlan":"STANDARD","usage":{"inputTokens":9144,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":8888,"cacheReadTokens":256},"outputTokens":3762,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":374,"reasoningTokens":3388},"totalTokens":12906,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":9144,"completion_tokens":3762,"total_tokens":12906,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":3388},"cost":0.040476,"is_byok":false,"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.040476,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.017904,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.022572}},"reasoningTokens":3388,"cachedInputTokens":256,"costUsd":0.040476,"generationId":"gen-1784312713-6e6l8ips4mWPDCHaAVNZ","upstreamProvider":"xAI","servedModel":"x-ai/grok-4.5"},"provider":"atlascloud","modelId":"x-ai/grok-4.5","attempts":1,"durationMs":55400}],"armTrail":null,"armExtra":{"funnelAttempts":2,"relaxedFallback":false,"rejectionSummary":{"total":1,"phaseCounts":{"model":1,"postprocess":0,"quality":0},"topCodes":[],"lastIssue":{"phase":"model","qualityMode":"strict","subType":"FILL_BLANK_KEY","message":"Invalid JSON response"},"message":"Rejected candidates: 1 | Last: model/FILL_BLANK_KEY - Invalid JSON response"}},"passageWords":180}
